        249.1,
        138.1,
        249.1
      ],
      "text": "The undersigned is directed to circulate for the information of all Ministries of the Government of India a copy of the minutes recorded by the Prime Minister relating to -"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 3,
      "poly": [
        163.3,
        261.6,
        534.0,
        261.6,
        534.0,
        355.8,
        163.3,
        355.8
      ],
      "text": "(1) The appointment of Shri R.R.Diwakar, Member of the Constituent Assembly, as Minister of State for Information and Broadcasting with effect from the 7th December, 1948.\n(2) The appointment of Dr.Balkrishnan V.Keskar, Member of the Constituent Assembly, as Deputy Minister with effect from the 7th December, 1948. He will be attached to the Ministry of External Affairs & Commonwealth Relations."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "text",
